==English==

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|ML.}} {{term|recollectus|lang=la||remembered, composed}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|recolligo||lang=la|gather again, recover}}

====Pronunciation====
* {{a|UK}} {{enPR|rĕ-kə-lĕktʹ}}, {{IPA|/ɹɛkəˈlɛkt/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/r\Ek@"lEkt/}}
* {{a|US}} {{enPR|rĕ-kə-lĕktʹ}}, {{IPA|/rɛkəˈlɛkt/}}, {{X-SAMPA|/rEk@"lEkt/}}
* {{audio|en-us-recollect.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{rhymes|ɛkt}}

====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# To [[recall]]; to [[collect]] one's thoughts again, especially about past events.

